# Fecund Greenshell (4/6): "As long as you control ten or more lands, creatures you control get +2/+2" (CR 604.1, 613.4c). Turn 1:
# Lotus, Emerald and Jet pay for the Greenshell, Pearl for Devoted Hero (1/2), and each enters trigger puts a Forest onto the battlefield
# tapped: two lands. A Forest played every turn from turn 3 makes nine lands on turn 15: the Greenshell is still 4/6 and the Hero 1/2
# (one land short). The tenth Forest, on turn 17, makes the Greenshell 6/8 and the Hero 3/4, while Bot2's Triton Shorethief (1/2,
# its controller has two lands) is unchanged: the static pumps only creatures its controller controls.

